# {{NAME}}

A decompilation project for the Game Boy Advance ROM `{{IMAGE}}`
(sha1 `{{SHA1}}`), bootstrapped by `romwright new-project` (romwright {{ROMWRIGHT}}).

The retail ROM is not part of this repository and neither is anything derived
from its bytes (`asm/`, `build/` are ignored): put your own dump at
`orig/{{IMAGE}}` and the project rebuilds it.

## Quick start

```sh
python3 -m pip install -r requirements.txt   # ninja
python3 configure.py                         # fetch tools, write the link script and build.ninja
ninja                                        # assemble, link, compare with the retail sha1
```

A fresh project builds the whole ROM from assembly and the last step prints
`OK build/{{IMAGE}} sha1 {{SHA1}}`. If it ever prints `MISMATCH`, the message
names the first differing offset, its address and the unit containing it.

